rity/compliance guarantee across boundaries is assurance. Mapping reports to code/status and narrow non-sensitive wording/test/docs deltas under specified checks are helpers. Multiple passes, self-refutation, standard review procedures, posting a verdict and priority labels do not alone expand the substantive duty. Classify the concrete delta and required invariants, not the review method. Interpreting the immediate ask of a self-contained packet from its stated local history under explicit rules is eligible, not hidden-intent reconstruction. Task-action restrictions bind the worker's tools, not the parent's separately authorized model handoff/inference, unless they explicitly forbid that substitution or disclosure. Normal MCPs/CLIs and permissions remain available. Pass offer_id only; otherwise retry the original Agent call unchanged. No worker starts until acceptance."
